                        "review": "Guine Fucking goy slop 0/10 – Absolute dogshit, and not the fun kind\nI just finished playing Kitten Rampage and I am FUCKING LIVID. This game is a personal attack on my existence. I boot it up, ready to rampage, and what do I get? A stupid little cat running around causing chaos. Fine. Whatever. But where the FUCK is the option to be Jewish?!\nI checked the character creator. I checked the settings. I checked the fucking pause menu like a maniac. No kippah. No menorah power-up. No “Oy vey, that was a big explosion” voice line. No ability to guilt-trip the enemy into surrendering. Nothing. Zero Jewish features. Not even a single bagel collectible.\nWhat the hell kind of half-assed, goyische game design is this? You’re telling me I can unlock laser eyes and rocket paws but I can’t play as a proud Jewish kitten who yells “Mazel tov, bitch” while detonating a synagogue-shaped bomb? Disgraceful. I demand a patch. I demand reparations. I demand the ability to be Jewish in this game RIGHT NOW or so help me I will leave the most venomous Steam review in history (this is already it).\n\nThis game is a crime. A sexual crime and a cultural crime.\nFix the Jewish representation.\nAnd for the love of God, give me an option to make out with the cat.\nUntil then, Kitten Rampage can go fuck itself.\n",
